{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>60秒一叮即食!香甜嫩滑啖啖肉</p><p>華御結新推出叮叮香烤雞腿肉</p><p>小編發現華御結新推出一款微波爐叮叮香烤雞腿肉，只要叮60秒就食得，非常方便！香烤雞腿肉$18/6件，份量都幾多，肉質幾嫩滑，調味偏甜，食到尾會有啲膩，不過就好適合懶人又想補充蛋白質。</p><p>華御結 官方IG：@hanamusubiofficial</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178772433681987706_1543779096a8e8232065b1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178772434001771817_3677139836a8e823513703.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178772434311438886_4384168196a8e8237a972d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178772434525235849_555371536a8e8239d3895.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178772434736932608_9357227186a8e823c54064.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T06:19:54.861159+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":219,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}